# Server profile owner -> server.application_profile; nonsecret exact string enum.
# This example selects localization, cumulative M01-M16/account22. Omitted defaults
# to platform for compatibility; empty, false, unknown or contradictory values refuse.
# Valid independent YAML < explicit protected --env-file; ambient environment ignored.
# The same artifact supports a change; stop/restart required, no live reload.
# Locale deployment inputs use the separate documented renderer env, not this loader.
PROJECT_ONE_APPLICATION_PROFILE=localization
